    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yieen thuɔk luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn bua̱n yiëëni thuɔk luaak ti̱ti̱, tekɛ bua̱a̱n ce̱tnikɛ bööthkiɛn, kä ca kɛ moc lät rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tnikɛ mëë te watkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua gaakni yuɔr thok duëël ɔ a thil ram mi di̱i̱t kiɛ ŋuɛ̈t kɛ thok duëël ɔ bi wä yien ɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu thok kuec käny ca̱ŋ pɛn kä Cɛ-lɛm-yaa. Kä cua gaak yuɔr kɛ kui̱ gatdɛ ni Dhɛ-kar-yaa, ɛ ram mi la lat luek, mi gɔaa, cu thok kuec caam pɛn kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu thok kuec cuëëc pɛn kä O-bed-ɛ-dom, kä cu gaak duëël tɔ̱ɔ̱wä pɛn kä gaatkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu thok kuec konyä ca̱ŋ kɛnɛ thok in lot ni Ca-lɛ-kɛth min te thok duɔ̱p nhiam pɛn kä Cu-pim kɛnɛ Otha. Kä guic yieen ni yieen in dɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la ji̱ Lii-bay da̱ŋ bäkɛl a yien thok kuec käny ca̱ŋ kɛ cäŋ kɛl, kä la ŋuaan a yien thok kuec caam kɛ cäŋ kɛl, kä bi ŋuaan yien thok kuec cuëëc kɛ cäŋ kɛl, kä la nɛy da̱ŋ rɛw a yien kɛɛl kɛ cäŋ kɛl thok duëël tɔ̱ɔ̱wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duɔ̱p in wä kui̱ konyä ca̱ŋ, te nɛy da̱ŋ ŋuaan dup nhial kä te rɛw dup pa̱a̱ny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua jɛn dääk yiëëni thuɔk luaak Kuɔth kɛ lätkiɛn, tëë la gaat Kora kɛnɛ Mɛ-ra-ri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ro̱o̱m yio̱o̱ni kɛnɛ bööth tin kɔ̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ Lii-bay cu Ä-ɣi-yaa a ro̱o̱m yio̱o̱ni luaak Kuɔth kɛnɛ muc tin ca lɛy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu La-dan gat Ger-com tekɛ gaat ti la bööth thukni duëli. Cu Yɛ-ɣe-li a kɛl thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Yɛ-ɣe-li a Dhe-tham kɛnɛ däman ni Yo-el a ro̱o̱m yio̱o̱ni luaak Kuɔth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gaat Am-ram kɛnɛ gaat Yidh-ɣar kɛnɛ U-dhi-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua Cɛ-bu-el gat Ger-com gat Muthɛ la bo̱o̱th röm yio̱o̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Ɛ-li-dhɛr a. Rɛ-ɣɛ̈b-yaa kɛnɛ Yɛ-cɛ̈-yaa kɛ Yo-ram kɛnɛ Dhik-ri kɛ Cɛ-lo-moth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Cɛ-lo-moth kɛnɛ ji̱ maarädɛ, yio̱w mucni diaal tëë ca lɛy ɛ kuäär ni Dee-bid kɛnɛ bööth bathdɔɔri kɛnɛ kuri kɛ bööth rɛ̈m rɔm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ kä tëë pɛ̈ckɛ ko̱o̱r lɛy kɛ ɣöö ba kɛ bany luak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua tëë ca lɛy ɛ gök ni Tha-muɛl kɛnɛ Thɔɔl gat Kic kɛ Ä-bi-ner gat Ner kɛ Yo-ab gat Dhɛ-ru-yaa, kɛ te kɔ̱ŋ tëë ca lɛy rɔm ɛ Cɛ-lo-moth kɛnɛ ji̱ maarädɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lät ji̱ Lii-bay tin kɔ̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
